OL,3,GNEWSAExtreme porn led police to
OL,4,Ahusband, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police investigation into a man who
OL,7,Fsexually abused his wife was sparked
OL,8,Fafter he put extreme pornographic
OL,9,Fimages online, a court has heard.
OL,11,FPhilip Young, a former Tory councillor
OL,12,Ffor Swindon, has admitted to drugging
OL,13,Fand raping his now ex-wife Joanne over
OL,14,Fa 13-year period.
OL,16,FFour men who Young is alleged to have
OL,17,Frecruited to abuse his wife at their
OL,18,Fhome are now on trial.
